# ⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Forgetting to store the next pointer before changing links.

❌ Updating pointers in the wrong order.

❌ Dereferencing NULL pointers.

❌ Infinite loops due to cycles.

❌ Not handling empty or single-node lists.

